{"id":"u-fec87d2d-ee1f-4c26-9bb4-b11364a221cd","src":"community","title":"GET YOUR GIRLFRIEND TO THE GYM","author":"Bartlomiej F.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/FMtLmJ-get-your-girlfriend-to-the-gym","desc":"Getting started with gym journey, classic 3x5 compound lifts mixed with hypertrophy work.\n\nLinear progression on all the lifts, \n\nFeel free to use any weight schemes, \nthe most enjoyable for my gf was:\n\nfor compound lifts, piramid (15kgx5, 17.5x5, 20x5, next session 17.5x5, 20x5, 22.5x5…) stick with 2.5kg jumps for lower body and 1.25kg for upper\n\nDouble progression for accessories.\n\nRemember to listen to your gf opinion about exercise selection and schemes and adjust accordingly, don’t be a dick and make it easy for her. Focus more on building consistency with the gym and less going super hard with perfect technique, MAKE WORKOUT ENJOYABLE AND FUN FIRST.","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":4,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-08-25T21:04:57.904Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["A","B"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hip Thrust (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lying Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Sumo Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":